		(property "Description" "The TPP60308 is a 60-V, 3.5-A output, non-synchronous, step-down, and switch-mode converter with integrated high-side power MOSFET. The TPP60308 employs current-mode control supporting simple external compensation and flexible component selection. It also supports low quiescent current mode with pulse-skipping and ultra-low sleep current. With the integrated phase-locked loop, the TPP60308 can synchronize with an external clock source with wide frequency selection, optimized for efficiency, physica"
